{"id":"5504b232d98f6167","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-uniformization-property.md","title":"ZFC Uniformization Property","display":"df-zfc-uniformization-property — ZFC Uniformization Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-uniformization-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-uniformization-property","58-df-zfc-descriptive3-uniformization-property"],"display":"df-zfc-uniformization-property — ZFC Uniformization Property","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-uniformizing-function.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-uniformization-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-uniformization-property</span><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-uniformization-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-uniformization-property — ZFC Uniformization Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c4da5e95c10688be\" href=\"?note=c4da5e95c10688be\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a4adfa0b08aedeb8\" href=\"?note=a4adfa0b08aedeb8\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-uniformizing-function.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-uniformizing-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3169dc41990b4bbe\" href=\"?note=3169dc41990b4bbe\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,X,Y,R,f\\in V\">\\(\\Gamma,X,Y,R,f\\in V\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X\\times Y)\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X\\times Y)\\)</span> 是固定乘积空间上的 pointclass slice</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StandardBorel}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{StandardBorel}\\subseteq V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3169dc41990b4bbe\" href=\"?note=3169dc41990b4bbe\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4UniformizingFunction}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4UniformizingFunction}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（参数顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,Y,R,f)\">\\((X,Y,R,f)\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a4adfa0b08aedeb8\" href=\"?note=a4adfa0b08aedeb8\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-uniformizing-function.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-uniformizing-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniformizationProperty}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{UniformizationProperty}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（参数顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma,X,Y)\">\\((\\Gamma,X,Y)\\)</span>，本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}uniformization\\text{-}property} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{UniformizationProperty}_S(\\Gamma;X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{StandardBorel}(X)\\land\\operatorname{StandardBorel}(Y)\\land\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X\\times Y)\\land\n\\forall R\\in\\Gamma\\;\n\\exists f\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4UniformizingFunction}_S(X,Y,R,f)\\land\nf\\in\\Gamma\n\\right]\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}uniformization\\text{-}property} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{UniformizationProperty}_S(\\Gamma;X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{StandardBorel}(X)\\land\\operatorname{StandardBorel}(Y)\\land\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X\\times Y)\\land\n\\forall R\\in\\Gamma\\;\n\\exists f\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4UniformizingFunction}_S(X,Y,R,f)\\land\nf\\in\\Gamma\n\\right]\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该谓词是固定标准 Borel 空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 上的 slice-level uniformization；不再把 pointclass 当作从真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 的集合函数。</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-uniformization-property</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4da5e95c10688be","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-uniformizing-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"a4adfa0b08aedeb8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-uniformizing-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"3169dc41990b4bbe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"3169dc41990b4bbe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{StandardBorel}\\subseteq V$（see [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-uniformizing-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"a4adfa0b08aedeb8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4UniformizingFunction}_S\\subseteq V^4$（参数顺序为 $(X,Y,R,f)$，see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-uniformizing-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma,X,Y,R,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X\\times Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StandardBorel}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4UniformizingFunction}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"(X,Y,R,f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniformizationProperty}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Gamma,X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}uniformization\\text{-}property} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{UniformizationProperty}_S(\\Gamma;X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{StandardBorel}(X)\\land\\operatorname{StandardBorel}(Y)\\land\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X\\times Y)\\land\n\\forall R\\in\\Gamma\\;\n\\exists f\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4UniformizingFunction}_S(X,Y,R,f)\\land\nf\\in\\Gamma\n\\right]\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1697,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3855","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-uniformization-property.md|58-df-zfc-uniformization-property]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["c4da5e95c10688be","a4adfa0b08aedeb8","3169dc41990b4bbe"]}